WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
WAZO v2.0.0 - One clear view of your financial life.

00:04.000 --> 00:08.000
See the whole picture - portfolio, household net worth, and allocation.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.000
Track assets and SIPs - review recurring investments before they post.

00:12.000 --> 00:16.000
Keep every financial year - manage historical periods without losing context.

00:16.000 --> 00:20.000
Plan your financial life - goals, income, budgets, and long-range clarity.

00:20.000 --> 00:24.000
See obligations clearly - liabilities, taxes, and household responsibility.

00:24.000 --> 00:28.000
Use Zakat tools when needed - cycles, evidence, payments, and review states.

00:28.000 --> 00:32.000
Understand performance - CAGR, XIRR, trends, and calculation context.

00:32.000 --> 00:36.000
Turn records into reports - export useful views for review and planning.

00:36.000 --> 00:40.000
Protect your workspace - portable backup, restore, and recovery evidence.

00:40.000 --> 00:44.000
Private by design - offline-first control with Privacy Mode.

00:44.000 --> 00:48.000
Move forward safely - existing-user migration with protected recovery.

00:48.000 --> 00:52.000
WAZO - wealth, organized clearly.
